[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://cnpc0inmate001"]

; The INMATE - the only other soul in the cell block, in the left cell.
; She's the FIRST breadcrumb: she saw the witness marched past and tells you
; he's in interrogation right now, pointing you there (sets inmate_tip).
; Talking pushes the camera in through the bars for a face-to-face shot.

